# Public API

Use the API when a service needs to retrieve project data outside the dashboard. Authenticate server-side with a project key, bound every request to the intended project, and request only the fields required by the job.

For ingestion, prefer the [Ingestion API](/docs/api). For existing OpenTelemetry pipelines, use [OTLP](/docs/integrations). Keep application-specific exports and dashboard reads separate so a reporting job cannot accidentally become part of the production trace path.
